    "bus_fare_cap_2027": {
      "description": "Single bus fares on participating services in England outside London are capped at £2 from 1 January to 31 December 2027. DfT announced this cap in July 2026, before the Autumn Budget, so the actual pre-Budget and current-law scenarios both retain it. Its incremental Budget effect is zero on this reference. London is outside the national cap.",
